it is now. To put yourself in the here and now, you must not think about anything else but what you are seeing right there – on stage or screen;
– Avoid over-intellectualizing: do not try to analyze everything that happens while watching a play (or movie). Just let go and enjoy! Think of it like this: when going into an art gallery, some people will look at every piece carefully; others might see just one painting or sculpture but still have their mind racing with all sorts of thoughts about its meaning – why was he/she painted in such a way? What does this symbolize for me personally, etc.
